고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:신명 태고딕;mso-hansi-font-family:한컴돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">&nbsp;ⓑ </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:신명 태고딕;font-family:신명 태고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:신명 태고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">2023-1</span><span style=\"font-family:신명 태고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:신명 태고딕;font-size:11.0pt;\">학기 한국장학재단 학자금지원 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:신명 태고딕;font-family:신명 태고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:신명 태고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family:신명 태고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:신명 태고딕;font-size:11.0pt;\">구간 이하</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 130%; margin-left: 16.2pt; text-indent: -16.2pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:신명 태고딕;font-size:8.0pt;\"> </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 130%; margin-left: 16.2pt; text-indent: -16.2pt;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:신명 태고딕;font-family:신명 태고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:신명 태고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">(3) 2023-1</span><span style=\"font-family:신명 태고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:신명 태고딕;font-size:11.0pt;\">학기 등록금 실납입액이 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:신명 태고딕;font-family:신명 태고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:신명 태고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">50</span><span style=\"font-family:신명 태고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:신명 태고딕;font-size:11.0pt;\">만원 이상인 자</span></b></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 18.2pt; text-indent: -18.2pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -18.9pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">아</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -18.9pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"text-indent: -18.9pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">신청방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -18.9pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"text-indent: -18.9pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">서울장학재단 홈페이지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -18.9pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(www.hissf.or.kr)</span><span style=\"text-indent: -18.9pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">에서 온라인 신청</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 18.2pt; text-indent: -18.2pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -18.9pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -18.9pt; font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -18.9pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">안내사항</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 130%; margin-left: 18.9pt; text-indent: -18.9pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">       </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">대학 심사 운영기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">: 2023.5.11(</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">) ~ 5.23(</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">화</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">) </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 130%; margin-left: 18.9pt; text-indent: -18.9pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">       </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">최종선정결과 발표 및 장학금 지급</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">: 2023.6</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; 